  "configuration_id": "config_017",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence shows scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted (config_027, 0.725 acc) is the best configuration so far. With scgpt, weighted fusion consistently outperformed concat (0.520 vs 0.507 for transformer; similar gap expected for avgpool). However, the scgpt→scvi_n200 shift was so large (~0.20 acc) that the relative ranking of fusion strategies could plausibly differ. Config_017 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, concat) is the single most direct exploitation of the best config, testing whether concat fusion might match or exceed weighted in the scvi_n200 regime. If it does, it opens a new direction; if not, it confirms weighted is optimal and lets us redirect remaining budget to image encoder (resnet50) or profile setting. With 3 experiments left after this, resolving the fusion question early maximizes the information value of the remaining trials."
}

